        "body": "The Department of Defense is the primary buyer, obligating $1.1B in FY2026 to date. The General Services Administration is the only other buyer listed among the top agencies, obligating $2.1M. Buying is concentrated in defense accounts, and other agencies do not appear among the top buyers for FY2026 to date."
      },
      {
        "heading": "What products and services does Bell Boeing Joint Project Office deliver to the government?",
        "body": "Other Aircraft Parts and Auxiliary Equipment Manufacturing is the largest market at $682M, followed by Aircraft Manufacturing at $333M. Bell Boeing Joint Project Office records $35.2M in Computer Systems Design Services and smaller obligations in manufacturing and engineering categories, including $5.1M in Other Metal Valve and Pipe Fitting Manufacturing, $2.1M in Engineering Services, and $0 in Machine Tool Manufacturing."
      }
